      en: ["Pasir Gudang is home to one of the largest petrochemical complexes in Southeast Asia.", "The area encompasses two major ports: Johor Port and Tanjung Langsat Port.", "The Pasir Gudang World Kite Festival has been held annually since 1995.", "The industrial town was established in the 1970s on former plantation land.", "The Johor Circuit, Malaysia's first international racing circuit, was located here.", "The industrial zone serves as a global hub for the refining of palm oil products."],
      es: ["El desarrollo de la zona industrial de Pasir Gudang comenzó en 1977.", "El puerto de Johor Port en Pasir Gudang es el puerto de transbordo de aceite de palma más grande del mundo.", "Una central eléctrica local suministra hasta 708 megavatios de energía eléctrica.", "En la región, el grupo Malaysia Marine and Heavy Engineering opera grandes astilleros.", "La zona industrial está conectada directamente con la cercana Singapur a través de autopistas.", "La ciudad obtuvo oficialmente el estatus de Consejo Municipal (Majlis Perbandaran) en 2020."],
      pt: ["O desenvolvimento da zona industrial de Pasir Gudang começou em 1977.", "O porto de Johor Port em Pasir Gudang é o maior porto de transbordo de óleo de palma do mundo.", "Uma central elétrica local fornece até 708 megawatts de energia elétrica.", "Na região, o grupo Malaysia Marine and Heavy Engineering opera grandes estaleiros.", "A zona industrial está ligada diretamente à vizinha Singapura através de autoestradas.", "A cidade obteve oficialmente o estatuto de Conselho Municipal (Majlis Perbandaran) em 2020."],
      fr: ["Le développement de la zone industrielle de Pasir Gudang a débuté en 1977.", "Le port de Johor à Pasir Gudang est le plus grand port de transbordement d'huile de palme au monde.", "Une centrale électrique locale fournit jusqu'à 708 mégawatts d'énergie électrique.", "Le groupe Malaysia Marine and Heavy Engineering exploite de grands chantiers navals dans la région.", "La zone industrielle est directement reliée à Singapour toute proche par des autoroutes.", "La ville a officiellement obtenu le statut de conseil municipal (Majlis Perbandaran) en 2020."],
